### SmartPoweredHome API – Manual Test Requests
### Requires X-Api-Key header for all endpoints

@host = http://localhost:5229
@apiKey = dev-api-key-2026

### Summary (count + date range)
GET {{host}}/api/powerconsumption/summary
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Paginated records (page 1, 10 per page)
GET {{host}}/api/powerconsumption?page=1&pageSize=10
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Paginated records filtered by date
GET {{host}}/api/powerconsumption?page=1&pageSize=10&date=1/1/26
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### All records (bulk – for client-side computation)
GET {{host}}/api/powerconsumption/all
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Push data for a date to all SignalR clients
POST {{host}}/api/powerconsumption/push?date=1/1/26
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Unauthenticated request (should return 401)
GET {{host}}/api/powerconsumption/summary
